{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Who delivered you from the hand of Egypt.</b> A harsh nation." "<b>And from the hand of Pharaoh.</b> A harsh king." "<b>From under the hand of Egypt.</b> As the Targum renders — a term of subjugation and domination; the 'hand' with which they burdened them is the labor."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:56.368935397Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}